{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26223","headline":"九日病起 · 殷尧藩","name":"九日病起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重阳开满菊花金，病起榰牀惜赏心。\n紫蟹霜肥秋纵好，绿醅蚁滑晚慵斟。\n眼窥薄雾行殊倦，身怯寒风坐未禁。\n沈醉又成来岁约，遣怀聊作记时吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}